workapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5263781d2912e4298c86915f09471162.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/55719a24a82e1dd203bc48fd564510f7d58a85ce8e0b9ea822f96c41391a3501/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Face9ba9815fd1007cfee02aca2d1940e.jpg\"/><h3>店鋪限定全期菜單</h3><p>左為Guadosalam的異界檸檬飲與點心巡禮套餐</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dc46684af50a9c7bfbee88fe198f253e343d9d5b81b1a22ad0723bfcfdf7fa24/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1d2e49db547d950f09a76c0d1d2bced5.jpg\"/><p>Guadosalam的異界檸檬飲: 990日圓(含稅)</p><p>點心巡禮套餐: 1,320日圓(含稅)</p><p>左為Macalania Woods與比塞德野牛隊的水球章魚燒</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/90faa5483f55f1ffcca97d2217ab41962c448a9ad02b66f2e73a4a09991195ea/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd066942c51b290a8d3f723a43ef5c52c.jpg\"/><p>Macalania Woods: 990日圓(含稅)</p><p>比塞德野牛隊的水球章魚燒: 1,210日圓(含稅)</p><p>左為卡卡賽特山與\"說不定這是最後一次了？\"豆醬義大利麵</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/12c1defe1e52b5e652a125d2a8ffe963760aaec3e5da53ee1ef3772bcf0f2aaa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F73760f3cf963c94f1e60c2dcdb90e510.jpg\"/><p>卡卡賽特山: 880日圓(含稅)</p><p>\"說不定這是最後一次了？\"豆醬義大利麵: 1,870日圓(含稅)</p><h3>咖啡廳空間使用特典</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9a03e06190ffe0f4bf98752bd516d43d9f37ccf2e8c672bb6acd68818f781993/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa019127e8d591c3f44fe225762fd6ca0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/10e2e37942c70b88d4114d5d4f16d4902c06c73cfadacbb994bae7a38a418807/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd61a541099fe97abfa7ad662cc2fb4c0.jpg\"/><h3>聯名菜單點餐特典</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b9f342dbde407d866c821458458cc52d38a4c9f7851bf81103cf6bd81640bb42/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4698d98565dcfca3098a7384e61cd62b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a3d27c0b89871bc82a248d75040c068987cc3f755654b5647675ddcf34b10893/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fae6bf4260b56546b7d4facd1bdaca49b.jpg\"/><p>🔸FF系列名曲從復古映像管電視造型玩具中流淌而出！「-FINAL FANTASY Series- Mini Melody TV」確定發售 🔸PlayStation最新資訊節目「State of Play」將於9月3日(四)日本時間22時起播出！屆時將介紹「FINAL FANTASY VII REVELATION」的相關資訊及播放深入探討亞洲遊戲的「State of Play 日本」 🔸「FINAL FANTASY VII REVELATION」第二支預告片公開！描繪克勞德等人與星球守護者「兵器」對戰的場景 🔸「勇者鬥惡龍怪物仙境4 枯木國的碧安卡與芙蘿拉」官方網站更新！新增旅途中相遇的角色及道具「聖鳥噴壺」的資訊 🔸「勇者鬥惡龍 人生遊戲」確定於10月24日發售！能體驗到細節中充滿DQ世界觀的桌遊</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T07:04:51.783111+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2013,"images":25,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}